  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "触发按钮显示当前色块 + hex；点开面板可选 16 个预设色、拖色相条实时改色，点色块即应用并收起。",
  "usage": "主题色、标签色、图表配色这类需要自选一个色值的场景；有常用色板 + 少量精调需求时，桌面端为主。",
  "caution": "需要精确调饱和度 / 明度或手输任意 hex 时用完整取色器（色轮 + S/V 面板 + 输入框）；颜色数量有限的系统只给预设、别放色相条。",
  "hint": "点按钮展开色板，拖色相条实时改色，点色块即应用",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【颜色选择器 Color Picker】目标：一个触发按钮显示「小色块 + hex 值 + 下拉箭头」，点开一个浮层面板：面板顶部是 34px 圆角大色块 + 12.5px 等宽 hex；中间 8 列 × 2 行共 16 个预设色小方块；底部一条彩虹色相条 + 圆形滑块。拖动色相条时大色块、hex、触发按钮三处实时同步；点任意预设色即应用并收起面板；点面板外或按 Esc 也收起。全部用 HSL→HEX 自己算，不引第三方库。\n\n1) 结构：body 用 flex 列、align-items:flex-start、padding 10（卡片靠上，给下方面板留空间）。.card（position:relative、宽 min(320px,100%)、margin 0 auto、圆角 14、padding 10 12、底色 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg))、描边 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)）> button.trigger（height 34、padding 0 10、gap 8、border 1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent)、圆角 9、底 var(--ui-bg)；内部：span.swatch 20×20 圆角 6 + span.hex 11.5px 600 等宽 + 12px 的向下 chevron SVG）+ div.panel（position:absolute、left 8 right 8、top 50、z-index 20、padding 8、圆角 11、底 var(--ui-surface)、描边 13% 文本色、阴影 0 14px 34px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent)、纵向 flex gap 7）。\n\n2) 面板内容三层：① .pvRow（50/34px 预览色块 + .pvMeta：hex 12.5px 700 等宽 + 8.5px 灰字说明）；② .swatches（display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:4px；每个 .sw 是 button、width 100%、aspect-ratio:1、border-radius 6、1px 描边 text 14%；hover scale(1.08)、按下 scale(.9)；当前色加 `.on`：`box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ui-surface),0 0 0 3.5px var(--ui-brand)` 双层描边）；③ .hue（position:relative、height 22、touch-action:none、user-select:none），内含 .hueTrack（absolute、左右 0、top 50%、height 8、圆角 999、`background:linear-gradient(to right,#f00,#ff0,#0f0,#0ff,#00f,#f0f,#f00)`、内阴影 1px text 12%）和 button.hueThumb（absolute、16×16、白/画布色 2px 描边、圆形、透明底、外阴影 1.5px text 35%，`::after{inset:-11px}` 扩大命中区；`left` 用百分比按 hue/360 定位，`margin-left:-8px` 抵消自身宽度）。\n\n3) 颜色计算：`hslToHex(h,s,l)`——c=(1-|2l-1|)s，x=c(1-|(h/60)%2-1|)，m=l-c/2，按 6 个 60° 扇区取 r/g/b，最后 `Math.round((v+m)*255)` 转两位大写十六进制拼接 `#RRGGBB`。默认色 #3B82F6 对应 h=217、s=.72、l=.60；拖色相条时固定 s/l，只改 h，实时算新 hex。\n\n4) 交互：点 trigger 切换面板开合（`aria-expanded` 同步，开时把焦点给色相滑块 `focus({preventScroll:true})`）；面板用 opacity + translateY(-4px)+scale(.98) → none 过渡（0.15/0.17 秒，`cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)`），关闭时 `pointer-events:none`；点 swatch 立即应用并关面板；document 上 mousedown 判断点击是否在 .card 外，Esc 关面板。色相条拖拽：pointerdown 里 preventDefault + setPointerCapture，pointermove 用 `(clientX - trackRect.left)/trackRect.width` 算 0–1 再乘 360；pointerup/pointercancel/lostpointercapture 收尾；键盘 ←/→ 每次 ±2（Shift ×10）。\n\n5) 无障碍：trigger 带 aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" + aria-expanded；面板 role=\"dialog\" + aria-label；每个 swatch 是 button + aria-label「选择颜色 #XXXXXX」；色相滑块 role=\"slider\"、aria-valuemin 0 / max 360 / now 实时更新、aria-label「色相」；焦点环用 3px brand 18% 光环。\n\n6) 坑：①面板是绝对定位浮层，卡片预览只有 176px 高，必须把面板压到 ~120px（紧凑模式里把 swatch 改成 `height:20px;aspect-ratio:auto`，别让 8 列方块按正方形撑到 33px 高 ×2 行）——一开始用 aspect-ratio:1 面板高 145，面板底 199 > 176，整页多出 23px 滚动；②hex 要统一大写 + 两位补零，否则 `#3b82f6` 和 `#3B82F6` 比较会失败；③当前色的选中圈用两层 box-shadow（先画布色再品牌色），单层会糊在色块上；④触发按钮和面板里的色块都要更新，别只改预览；⑤色相条是固定彩虹渐变、预设色板是固定 16 色，这两处不跟随宿主主题，属于「配色方案」例外，其余底色/描边/文字必须全用 var(--ui-*) 与 color-mix 叠 --ui-text。\n\n7) 配色（宿主注入的 CSS 变量含义）：--ui-bg 画布、--ui-surface 卡片/面板、--ui-surface-2 次级表面、--ui-border 分隔线、--ui-text 正文、--ui-text-dim 次要、--ui-brand 主色（焦点环、选中圈）、--ui-success/--ui-warn/--ui-danger 状态色。面板底用 var(--ui-surface)（深色下是 #232324，浅色下是白），描边叠 text 13% 才在浅色下看得见。\n\n8) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环；首轮延迟 0.3 秒；一轮 = 复位 #3B82F6/hue 217/关面板 → 光标点 trigger（0.56 秒移动 + 0.19 秒按下）→ 面板打开 → 光标移到色相滑块、press 后用 rAF 在 0.7 秒内把色相从 217 拖到 285（每帧 cursor.at 到滑块位置，色块/hex 实时变）→ release → 0.26 秒后点第 5 个预设色（#22C55E）→ 应用并关面板 → 0.8 秒后 cursor.hide()、1.4 秒后复位；间隔 6.6 秒。\n\n9) 小视口（高度 ≤420）：body padding 8、卡片 padding 9 10、trigger 高 32、panel top 45 / padding 7 / gap 6、预览块 30、hex 11.5px、swatch 高 20、色相条高 18（轨道 7）。放大弹窗（高度 ≥421）：卡片宽 min(520px,100%)、padding 18 20、trigger 高 50 / 字号 15、色块 28、panel top 74 / padding 14 / gap 12、预览块 50 / 圆角 13、hex 17px、swatch 保持正方形（8 列各约 54px）、色相条高 32（轨道 12、滑块 24px）——740×733 里面板实测高 242px、底部 355px，完整可点。\n\n10) 使用场景：见 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:flex-start;padding:10px}\n\n.card{position:relative;width:min(320px,100%);margin:0 auto;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;flex:0 0 auto}\n\n.trigger{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;height:34px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);border-radius:9px;background:var(--ui-bg);color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease,transform .1s ease}\n.trigger:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 26%,transparent)}\n.trigger.pressing{transform:scale(.98)}\n.trigger:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 18%,transparent)}\n.swatch{width:20px;height:20px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 16%,transparent);transition:background .15s ease}\n.trigger .hex{flex:1;min-width:0;text-align:left;font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,\"Courier New\",monospace;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.trigger .chev{width:12px;height:12px;flex:0 0 auto;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n.panel{position:absolute;left:8px;right:8px;top:50px;z-index:20;padding:8px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 13%,transparent);box-shadow:0 14px 34px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px) scale(.98);pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .15s ease,transform .17s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.panel.open{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n\n.pvRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.pvSwatch{width:34px;height:34px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 16%,transparent);transition:background .12s ease}\n.pvMeta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;min-width:0}\n.pvMeta b{font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,\"Courier New\",monospace;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--ui-text)}\n.pvMeta span{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n.swatches{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:4px}\n.sw{appearance:none;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;padding:0;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;outline:none;transition:transform .1s ease,box-shadow .12s ease}\n.sw:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}\n.sw.pressing{transform:scale(.9)}\n.sw:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ui-brand)}\n.sw.on{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ui-surface),0 0 0 3.5px var(--ui-brand)}\n\n.hue{position:relative;height:22px;margin:0 1px;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.hueTrack{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:8px;margin-top:-4px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(to right,hsl(0 100% 50%),hsl(60 100% 50%),hsl(120 100% 50%),hsl(180 100% 50%),hsl(240 100% 50%),hsl(300 100% 50%),hsl(360 100% 50%));box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)}\n.hueThumb{position:absolute;top:50%;left:0;width:16px;height:16px;margin:-8px 0 0 -8px;padding:0;border:2px solid var(--ui-bg);border-radius:50%;background:transparent;box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 35%,transparent),0 1px 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);cursor:grab;outline:none;transition:transform .1s ease}\n.hueThumb::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-11px}\n.hueThumb:active{cursor:grabbing}\n.hueThumb.pressing{transform:scale(.92)}\n.hueThumb:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 25%,transparent)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:8px}\n  .card{padding:9px 10px;gap:4px}\n  .trigger{height:32px;font-size:11px;gap:7px}\n  .panel{top:45px;padding:7px;gap:6px;border-radius:10px}\n  .pvSwatch{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px}\n  .pvMeta b{font-size:11.5px}\n  .swatches{gap:4px}\n  .sw{aspect-ratio:auto;height:20px;border-radius:5px}\n  .hue{height:18px}\n  .hueTrack{height:7px;margin-top:-3.5px}\n}\n\n/* 放大弹窗（740×733）：面板与色板整体放大 */\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  body{padding:40px}\n  .card{width:min(520px,100%);padding:18px 20px;gap:10px;border-radius:18px}\n  .trigger{height:50px;padding:0 14px;gap:12px;font-size:15px;border-radius:12px}\n  .swatch{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px}\n  .trigger .hex{font-size:15px}\n  .trigger .chev{width:16px;height:16px}\n  .panel{left:12px;right:12px;top:74px;padding:14px;gap:12px;border-radius:14px}\n  .pvRow{gap:12px}\n  .pvSwatch{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:13px}\n  .pvMeta b{font-size:17px}\n  .pvMeta span{font-size:12px}\n  .swatches{gap:7px}\n  .sw{border-radius:8px}\n  .hue{height:32px}\n  .hueTrack{height:12px;margin-top:-6px}\n  .hueThumb{width:24px;height:24px;margin:-12px 0 0 -12px;border-width:3px}\n  .hueThumb::after{inset:-11px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .trigger,.panel,.swatch,.sw,.hueThumb,.pvSwatch{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\" id=\"card\">\n  <button class=\"trigger\" id=\"trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"swatch\" id=\"trigSwatch\"></span>\n    <span class=\"hex\" id=\"trigHex\">#3B82F6</span>\n    <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 4.6 L6 7.4 L9 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择颜色\">\n    <div class=\"pvRow\">\n      <span class=\"pvSwatch\" id=\"pvSwatch\"></span>\n      <div class=\"pvMeta\"><b id=\"pvHex\">#3B82F6</b><span>主题色 · 可拖动色相条</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"swatches\" id=\"swatches\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hue\" id=\"hue\">\n      <div class=\"hueTrack\" id=\"hueTrack\"></div>\n      <button class=\"hueThumb\" id=\"hueThumb\" type=\"button\" role=\"slider\" aria-label=\"色相\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"360\" aria-valuenow=\"217\"></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var card = document.getElementById('card'),\n      trigger = document.getElementById('trigger'),\n      panel = document.getElementById('panel'),\n      trigSwatch = document.getElementById('trigSwatch'),\n      trigHex = document.getElementById('trigHex'),\n      pvSwatch = document.getElementById('pvSwatch'),\n      pvHex = document.getElementById('pvHex'),\n      swatchesBox = document.getElementById('swatches'),\n      hue = document.getElementById('hue'),\n      hueThumb = document.getElementById('hueThumb');\n\n  /* 16 个常用预设色（固定色板，与宿主主题无关；色相条本身也是固定彩虹色） */\n  var PRESETS = ['#EF4444','#F97316','#F59E0B','#EAB308','#22C55E','#10B981','#06B6D4','#3B82F6',\n                 '#6366F1','#8B5CF6','#D946EF','#EC4899','#F43F5E','#64748B','#0F172A','#F1F5F9'];\n  var current = '#3B82F6';\n  var hueVal = 217;\n  var curHsl = { h: 217, s: 0.72, l: 0.60 };\n\n  var isOpen = false, dragging = false, timer = null, cursor = null, rafId = 0;\n\n  function hslToHex(h, s, l){\n    h = ((h % 360) + 360) % 360;\n    var c = (1 - Math.abs(2 * l - 1)) * s;\n    var x = c * (1 - Math.abs((h / 60) % 2 - 1));\n    var m = l - c / 2;\n    var r = 0, g = 0, b = 0;\n    if(h < 60){ r = c; g = x; }\n    else if(h < 120){ r = x; g = c; }\n    else if(h < 180){ g = c; b = x; }\n    else if(h < 240){ g = x; b = c; }\n    else if(h < 300){ r = x; b = c; }\n    else { r = c; b = x; }\n    function to2(v){ var n = Math.round((v + m) * 255); return (n < 16 ? '0' : '') + n.toString(16).toUpperCase(); }\n    return '#' + to2(r) + to2(g) + to2(b);\n  }\n\n  function paintAll(){\n    trigSwatch.style.background = current;\n    trigHex.textContent = current;\n    pvSwatch.style.background = current;\n    pvHex.textContent = current;\n    hueThumb.style.left = (hueVal / 360 * 100) + '%';\n    hueThumb.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', Math.round(hueVal));\n    var list = swatchesBox.querySelectorAll('.sw');\n    for(var i = 0; i < list.length; i++){\n      list[i].classList.toggle('on', list[i].getAttribute('data-hex') === current);\n    }\n  }\n\n  PRESETS.forEach(function(hex){\n    var b = document.createElement('button');\n    b.className = 'sw';\n    b.type = 'button';\n    b.setAttribute('data-hex', hex);\n    b.setAttribute('aria-label', '选择颜色 ' + hex);\n    b.style.background = hex;\n    b.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      current = hex;\n      paintAll();\n      closePanel();\n    });\n    swatchesBox.appendChild(b);\n  });\n\n  function openPanel(){\n    if(isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = true;\n    panel.classList.add('open');\n    trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n    try { hueThumb.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 忽略 */ }\n  }\n  function closePanel(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    panel.classList.remove('open');\n    trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n  }\n\n  trigger.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    if(isOpen) closePanel(); else openPanel();\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('mousedown', function(e){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    if(card.contains(e.target)) return;\n    closePanel();\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape' && isOpen) closePanel();\n  });\n\n  function hueFromX(clientX){\n    var r = hue.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var ratio = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (clientX - r.left) / r.width));\n    return ratio * 360;\n  }\n  function setHue(h){\n    hueVal = h;\n    curHsl.h = h;\n    current = hslToHex(h, curHsl.s, curHsl.l);\n    paintAll();\n  }\n\n  hueThumb.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n    e.preventDefault();\n    dragging = true;\n    hueThumb.classList.add('pressing');\n    try { hueThumb.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err){ /* 忽略 */ }\n    setHue(hueFromX(e.clientX));\n  });\n  hueThumb.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    setHue(hueFromX(e.clientX));\n  });\n  ['pointerup','pointercancel','lostpointercapture'].forEach(function(ev){\n    hueThumb.addEventListener(ev, function(){\n      dragging = false;\n      hueThumb.classList.remove('pressing');\n    });\n  });\n  hueThumb.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    var step = (e.shiftKey ? 10 : 2);\n    if(e.key === 'ArrowLeft' || e.key === 'ArrowDown'){ e.preventDefault(); setHue(hueVal - step); }\n    else if(e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === 'ArrowUp'){ e.preventDefault(); setHue(hueVal + step); }\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function clickEl(c, el, done){\n    if(!el || el.disabled){ if(done) done(); return; }\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      el.classList.add('pressing');\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release();\n        el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        done();\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function dragHue(c, from, to, dur, done){\n    c.moveTo(hueThumb);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      hueThumb.classList.add('pressing');\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n        setHue(from + (to - from) * eased);\n        var r = hue.getBoundingClientRect();\n        c.at(r.left + hueVal / 360 * r.width, r.top + r.height / 2);\n        if(t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n        else { hueThumb.classList.remove('pressing'); c.release(); done(); }\n      }\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    current = '#3B82F6'; hueVal = 217; curHsl = { h: 217, s: 0.72, l: 0.60 };\n    paintAll();\n    closePanel();\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c){ openPanel(); return; }\n    if(c.el) c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    clickEl(c, trigger, function(){\n      openPanel();\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        dragHue(c, 217, 285, 700, function(){\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            var target = swatchesBox.querySelectorAll('.sw')[4];\n            clickEl(c, target, function(){\n              current = target.getAttribute('data-hex');\n              paintAll();\n              closePanel();\n              setTimeout(function(){\n                if(typeof c.hide === 'function') c.hide();\n                setTimeout(function(){\n                  current = '#3B82F6'; hueVal = 217; paintAll();\n                }, 1400);\n              }, 800);\n            });\n          }, 260);\n        });\n      }, 240);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 6600); }, 300);\n  }\n\n  paintAll();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
  "createdAt": 1794379550295,
  "updatedAt": 1794379840062
}